# Package manager

Use npm in this workspace. Do not run pnpm.

- Install and add packages with `npm install` and `npm install <pkg>`.
- Run scripts with `npm run <script>`, including `npm run dev`.
- Do not add `pnpm-lock.yaml` or a `packageManager` field that names pnpm.
